{"id":"35bdb2233dfc3e43","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-time-constructible.md","title":"Time-Constructible Function","display":"df-time-constructible — Time-Constructible Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-time-constructible","aliases":["28-df-time-constructible","Time-Constructible Function"],"display":"df-time-constructible — Time-Constructible Function","depends_on":["[[28-df-tm]]","[[28-df-machine-resources]]"],"source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization","source_printed_pages":"16","source_pdf_pages":"42"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-time-constructible"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-time-constructible</span><span>Time-Constructible Function</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-time-constructible — Time-Constructible Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"16"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"42"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1965e2b0765554c9\" href=\"?note=1965e2b0765554c9\" title=\"28-df-tm\">28-df-tm</a> 定义的机器集。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\">\\(f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)\">\\(\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" href=\"?note=b5d4fc2d291ce98b\" title=\"28-df-machine-resources\">28-df-machine-resources</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(m)\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(m)\\)</span> 是自然数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的无前导零二进制表示，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\">\\(\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TC}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\mid\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\ge\\max\\{n,1\\}\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(M(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(f(|x|))\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c\\,f(|x|))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TC}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\mid\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\ge\\max\\{n,1\\}\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(M(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(f(|x|))\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c\\,f(|x|))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>使用二进制输出而非长度等于函数值的一元输出，避免把输出长度开销强加于原书定义。对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=0,1\">\\(n=0,1\\)</span> 采用正的界；有限初始值不影响本目录的渐近类。</p>\n<p>来源：所给 Arora–Barak PDF，§1.2.1，印刷 p.16 / PDF p.42。已核对本项所述原文；集合/元组编码是本目录的显式实现约定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-tm]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-machine-resources]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-tm","status":"resolved","id":"1965e2b0765554c9","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$ 为 [[28-df-tm]] 定义的机器集。","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-machine-resources","status":"resolved","id":"b5d4fc2d291ce98b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$；$\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)$ 来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]。$\\operatorname{bin}(m)$ 是自然数 $m$ 的无前导零二进制表示，$\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{time}_M,M(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(m)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{bin}(0)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TC}\\coloneqq\\{f:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\mid\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N\\;f(n)\\ge\\max\\{n,1\\}\\land\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\forall x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*\\;(M(x)=\\operatorname{bin}(f(|x|))\\land\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le c\\,f(|x|))\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"n=0,1","display":false}],"bytes":1413,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"资源函数：[[28-df-big-oh]]、[[28-df-time-constructible]]、[[28-df-space-constructible]]、[[28-df-dtime]]、[[28-df-ntime]]、[[28-df-dspace]]、[[28-df-nspace]]。"},{"id":"ea7158d315318373","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\Sigma=\\{0,1\\}$；$f:\\Sigma^*\\to\\Sigma$；$f_n=f\\upharpoonright\\Sigma^n$；$S\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，其中 $\\mathrm{TC}$ 见 [[28-df-time-constructible]]。\n$H_{\\mathrm{avg}}(f_n)$、$H_{\\mathrm{wrs}}(f_n)$ 使用 [[28-df-circuit-hardness]] 中总节点数电路硬度；$\\operatorname{DPRG}$ 使用 [[28-df-derandomization-prg]] 的渐近定义。$\\mathrm{TM},M(x),\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 也由后者的直接机器接口确定；$\\langle b\\rangle$ 为比特 $b$ 对应的单字符输出串。"},{"id":"645e23d166674b47","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 属于 [[28-df-time-constructible]] 的时间可构造函数类；$\\mathrm{NTIME}$ 见 [[28-df-ntime]]。"},{"id":"71205f67d1e76729","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$M\\in\\mathrm{TM}$，$t\\in\\mathrm{TC}$，see [[28-df-time-constructible]]。对所有 $x\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$ 有 $\\operatorname{time}_M(x)\\le t(|x|)$。输出/时间与无知觉性来自 [[28-df-machine-resources]]、[[28-df-oblivious-tm]]。"},{"id":"acebbed2a6b79dac","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$f,g:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$ 均属于 [[28-df-time-constructible]] 的时间可构造函数类，且对充分大的 $n$ 有 $f(n),g(n)\\ge n$。"}],"outgoing":["1965e2b0765554c9","b5d4fc2d291ce98b"]}